Package: hsync-desktop
Version: __VERSION__
Architecture: __ARCH__
Maintainer: Alberto Basso <17047798+albertsdk@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/albertsdk/hsync-desktop
Description: HSYNC - desktop GUI for file synchronization
  hsync-desktop is the Qt (PySide6) graphical front-end of the HSYNC
  sync network. It drives the hsync client binary and provides a
  tray-resident interface to configure and monitor folder syncs.
  .
  Requires hsync-client, which provides the /usr/bin/hsync engine.
Depends: hsync-client, libgl1, libegl1, libxkbcommon0, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libxcb-cursor0, libxcb-icccm4, libxcb-keysyms1, libxcb-shape0, libxcb-randr0, libxcb-render-util0, libxcb-xinerama0, libfontconfig1, libdbus-1-3
